config USB_XHCI_HCD
    tristate "xHCI USB host controller"
    default y
    help
      PCI xHCI host for SuperSpeed Bulk-Only SCSI storage and USB2/1.x
      Bulk-Only storage and boot HID keyboard/mouse, directly or through
      USB2/USB3 hubs. Supports hub status interrupts, TT routes and hotplug.
      M builds xhci.ko. Streams, isochronous endpoints and UAS are unsupported.
